WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One intention, many systems: travel, finance, customer support, teamwork, research, and home life.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Real tasks cross environments. Training tasks often stop at one environment.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
ToolSpace reverses the order: start with real tools.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Connect tools that actually work together, using evidence from real execution.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Build environments around what those tools need.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Follow one path: reconcile a budget, write the summary, and tell the team.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Read the budget and actual spend: 2000 budget, 1500 spent, 500 remaining.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Read the project routing to find the finance-review channel.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Explore a candidate route that sends the message first.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.500
The next write uses the wrong destination and is refused.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Restore the last state. Backtrack and undo the candidate message.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Try another route: write the summary to the correct spreadsheet.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.000
Send the summary. The workbook is updated and the team is informed.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Start over and replay the successful path. Check the saved summary and the message. Keep the verified task.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Results across all seven benchmarks. ToolSpace-744B-A40B with SFT averages 56.6; 8B and 35B improve further with RL after SFT.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Final scores on AutomationBench Pro and Tau3 Banking Pro.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.000
ToolSpace. Start with tools. Scale verifiable tasks.
